quired real-input and adversarial tests, including extraction-specific offsets, context tampering, overlapping revenue partitions, cash perimeter and rounding boundaries; execute the specified unittest and build/check commands.\",\n    \"Complete the 23 note dispositions and specific incorporation/version records, then submit the actual code, generated case, result report and test evidence for review_result.\"\n  ]\n}\nLOCAL INSTRUCTIONS\nAGENTS.md 3554\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
